8. The impugned FIR no. 201/2020 as well as the impugned Chargesheet No. 20/2021dated 12.10.2021 is being challenged by the petitioners, precisely on the following grounds:-
(i) The averments in the FIR, give only one conclusion that there is no legal basis on record forproceeding against petitioners and these averments are vague and omnibus;
(ii) The allegations do not satisfy the ingredients of Sections 304-B, 504, 306, 323,
109, 498-A ofIndian Penal Code and do not level allegation of any such nature which further clarifies that there is no ground for proceeding against the petitioners;
